## Decisions (settled)

1. **Scan** — keep camera + printed-text OCR. Do NOT build the digital-ink
   handwriting recognizer. Rewrite the tests to match production code.
2. **Reports** — finish the new mock-data ReportsScreen (Shop reports.html).
   Do NOT restore the old bundled-sales screen.
3. **Order completion** — remove the `who` / customer-name concept entirely.
   No name field, no name prompt.
4. **WORKTODO supersedes UNFINISHED_TASKS.txt**, which is deleted at step 5.3.
5. **`sales_seed.json` is kept** as a build-time input for a future real-data
   reports back end; the asset entry stays in pubspec.yaml.
6. **Offline history** — a process-lifetime in-memory repository, not a
   null-object. `OrderProvider.complete` refuses to finish an order it has
   nowhere to record, so a null-object would mean a tablet with no connection
   cannot sell anything at all. Implemented as step 1.11 / `4.5` below.

